        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906220/extras/7d7bfcbc6fb213b2b0184b91b001b12a.avif?t=1785870410\" width=648 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906220/extras/8083b261f957e5212bd33da3934e8a1a.avif?t=1785870410\" width=648 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The International Space Station makes a great discovery by extracting organic material from comet G3 Atlas. After analyzing the sample, they realize there is a form of life that infects the entire crew. The space station leaves its orbit and crashes on Earth. The life form assimilates humans and many other creatures, creating colossi (Kaiju) guardians that protect their creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several years pass, and the guardians realize they are slaves to their creator and attempt to rebel. To become stronger, they must fight among themselves to face their creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode for all 6 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 original music themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vs. AI mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade support for arcade sticks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A controller is required for local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full version of the game will include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 new playable characters, including their story modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stage “Collision Zone”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More comic pages in arcade mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906220/extras/7d7bfcbc6fb213b2b0184b91b001b12a.avif?t=1785870410\" width=648 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906220/extras/8083b261f957e5212bd33da3934e8a1a.avif?t=1785870410\" width=648 height=672 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The International Space Station makes a great discovery by extracting organic material from comet G3 Atlas. After analyzing the sample, they realize there is a form of life that infects the entire crew. The space station leaves its orbit and crashes on Earth. The life form assimilates humans and many other creatures, creating colossi (Kaiju) guardians that protect their creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several years pass, and the guardians realize they are slaves to their creator and attempt to rebel. To become stronger, they must fight among themselves to face their creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode for all 6 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 original music themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vs. AI mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade support for arcade sticks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A controller is required for local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full version of the game will include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 new playable characters, including their story modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stage “Collision Zone”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More comic pages in arcade mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
